SUMMARY:Hope - Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ Sara Bensman
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, October 16th\nEvening 
 Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nF
 acilitator Sara Bensman\n\nIntention: Hope\n\nIn times of change that are 
 unprecedented\, anxiety-producing and far reaching\, it feels helpful to e
 xplore the edges and embodied experience of the verb Hope.\n\nHope Is Not 
 a Bird\, Emily\, It’s a Sewer Rat\n*by Caitlin Seida*\n\nHope is not the
  thing with feathers\nThat comes home to roost\nWhen you need it most.\nHo
 pe is an ugly thing\nWith teeth and claws and\nPatchy fur that’s seen so
 me shit.\nIt’s what thrives in the discards\nAnd survives in the ugliest
  parts of our world\,\nAble to find a way to go on\nWhen nothing else can 
 even find a way in.\nIt’s the gritty\, nasty little carrier of such\ndis
 eases as\noptimism\, persistence\,\nPerseverance and joy\,\nTransmissible 
 as it drags its tail across\nyour path\nand\nbites you in the ass.\nHope i
 s not some delicate\, beautiful bird\,\nEmily.\nIt’s a lowly little sewe
 r rat\nThat snorts pesticides like they were\nLines of coke and still\nSho
 ws up on time to work the next day\nLooking no worse for wear.\n\n## About
  Sara Bensman\n\nSara’s mix-making arises from musical exploration. She 
 seeks to understand energy through somatic responses to sonic vibrations. 
 Her facilitation is propelled by a desire to help build and sustain commun
 ity by creating a safe\, loving container for self-expression\, connection
  and release. If you’d like to listen to her sets visit [https://soundcl
 oud.com/sara-bensman](https://soundcloud.com/sara-bensman)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\
 n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close prom
 ptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please 
 be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $
 15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre
 -registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer 
 and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementc
 ollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/voluntee
 r/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkED
 IyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELh
 DttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor
  will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY 
 AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashev
 illemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective
 .org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNyd
 GMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwg
 nJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAshevil
 le Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all a
 re free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our missio
 n and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-f
 orm dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation
 . AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Ash
 eville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
