SUMMARY:The Tao of Unknotting - Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Conway Weary
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, October 18th\n1st Danc
 e Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance 
 Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nAuxiliary
  Facilitator Conway Weary\n\nIntention: The Tao of Unknotting\nA blessing 
 on the knots that were tied into you\, and that you learnt to tie into you
 rself\, until you were woven into a net that could catch approval and dipl
 omas and lovers.\n\nA blessing on your toil that yielded worldly riches wh
 en you were cast into the great ocean of suffering and returned laden with
  jewels and trinkets and heartbreak.\n\nA blessing on the seaweed that clo
 gged your mesh and dragged you down and snagged you on rocks and anchors.\
 n\nA blessing on the tide that stranded you on this shore\, discarding you
  like debris\, rendering your knotted self useless.\n\nA blessing on the k
 nots that were tied into you\, and that you tied into yourself. May each o
 ne loosen now. Though it once held you together and made you strong\, it b
 inds you where you no longer need to be bound.\n\nSomething greater holds 
 you now. May this knot loosen\, and this\, and this.\n\nA blessing on your
  unravelling that feels a little like insanity. You're not going mad. May 
 the sun warm the places that were tied so tight it felt like suffocating. 
 And now that it is safe\, to soften\, to loosen\, to breathe\, fill your l
 ungs with the oxygen of freedom. Exhale. May your soul be released from th
 e bondage of survival\, and unlaced\, relax into unboundedness. And bask i
 n the blessing of letting go.\n\nBy Shao Lan\n\n## About Conway Weary\n\nC
 onway remembers the moment. Her first grade teacher\, Mrs. Dean\, lined up
  the girls\, put Tchaikovsky on the record player and said\, "Pretend you 
 are a flower". That ecstatic meeting of music\, movement and imagination w
 as a moment that set a life direction. The Dancer's Path is where the outs
 ide meets the inside\, the healer meets the wound\, and body and soul play
  passionately with the edges of life. [www.mixcloud.com/conwayweary/](http
 ://www.mixcloud.com/conwayweary/)\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that th
 e dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and 
 any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe
  and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price
 .\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\
 n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Registe
 r to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](h
 ttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTA
 AYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XG
 dFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1po
 otRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginnin
 g of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH W
 AVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/
 our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZX
 h0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgy
 MDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem
 _nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envi
 sions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authent
 ic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire au
 thenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance 
 waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonpro
 fit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee yo
 u on the dance floor!
